window.products.push({"id":1090119,"name":"linoroso Serrated Bread Knife for Homemade Bread,Ultra Sharp Forged German High Carbon Stainless Steel Blade(8 inch),Full Tang,Ergonomic Handle- MAKO ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kcgrCfZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【Premium Material】The Linoroso MAKO series 8'' bread knife is made from imported expertly forged single piece of ice tempered German high carbon, stainless steel, one of the best culinary cutlery materials on the market. Outstanding craftsmanship, cutting-edge technology. Peak performance has never looked so good at this price. ✔【Incredibly Razor Sharp】The blade of the Linoroso MAKO series 8'' bread knife is sharpened by an automatic grinding machine that precisely achieves 14-16 degrees. Geometrically angled serrations ensure effortlessly thin slicing with a single stroke, minimal crumb dispersion with breads, and painlessly smooth cutting of large fruits, cabbage, sandwiches, and boneless hams without squashing tender interiors ✔【Modern, Innovative Design】With its modern, stunning handle design, this 8'' bread knife is perfect for making scalloped edge cuts through a harder crust or peel without squashing tender interiors. More than just mere esthetics, the ergonomic handle shape is engineered for superior control, agility and comfort. Full tang that runs the entire length of the handle for superior balance. ✔【Expertly Crafted】Through a rigorous hardening process that involves vacuum heat treatment and rapid cooling, the blade comes in at staggering 56+ on the Rockwell hardness scale. Carefully tapered for improved hardness, flexibility, and minimal slicing resistance. Tall blade height provides useful knuckle clearance. ✔ 【Lifetime and 100% Money Back Guarantee 】If for any reason, your product proves to be unsatisfactory, please contact us to manage full refund or replacement. Please enjoy your purchase without risk.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kcgrCfZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"linoroso","source_asin":"B085DP1GGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085DP1GGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085DP1GGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
