window.products.push({"id":1090129,"name":"3 Quart Whistling Tea Kettle - Modern Stainless Steel Whistling Tea Pot for Stovetop with Cool Grip Ergonomic Handle - Brush Copper Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gKgjAC4ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KITCHEN MUST HAVE: Remember the whistle of the kettle when your mom made you tea when you were sick or hot chocolate during the holidays You dont get that magic with the electric tea kettles, but you do get it with the Diamond Home Home Stainless Steel Whistling Tea Kettle. All the memories come pouring back with this beautiful kitchen piece. Whistling tea kettle can heat up 3 quarts of water or liquid for your tea. Pour up to 12 cups of liquid from this kettle. COOL COMFORTABLE HANDLE: The ergonomic handle is designed to contour to a natural hand grip to make it easier to pour, even when the kettle is full. No more heavy kettles and hand fatigue. It also stays cool so you don’t have to worry about letting anything cool down. Steep your tea right away or with absolutely no problem pouring. HIGH QUALITY STAINLESS STEEL: The kettle is crafted from high quality 18/8 stainless steel for reliable construction, ensuring that your kettle lasts season after season and cuppa after cuppa. The stainless steel also provides even heat distribution throughout the kettle for more efficient and quick boiling power. HIGH CAPACITY SIZE: This kettle can contain 2.8 quarts of water at a time which translates to 11 cups of hot water. Throw a tea party and entertain a whole crowd right away from just one kettle. It’s also perfect for heating up water for those instant noodles and mashed potatoes too, making it just the right size for all people and lifestyles. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: Package contains (1) Diamond Home 2.8 Quart Stainless Steel 18/8 Large Tea Whistling Kettle with Trigger Spout . Works on both electric and gas stovetops. Brushed stainless steel finish. Soft grip with one hand trigger. Whistle when boiling feature. 2.8 quart / 11 cup capacity. Limited lifetime warranty. Has a one-hand trigger mechanism that allows for easy and convenient pouring.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gKgjAC4ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"diamondhome","source_asin":"B00TFW3P4W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TFW3P4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TFW3P4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
