window.products.push({"id":1090203,"name":"EForces Instant Read Meat Thermometer, Digital Waterproof Cooking Thermometer Kitchen Thermometer with Folding Probe, Custom Alarms, Voice Prompts, an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lTmjWGELL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Cooking meat can be tricky, for the temperature is difficult to control?However, cook safely doesn’t necessarily means sacrificing tastes. EForces Digital Meat Thermometers boasts a 4.25\" food-grade stainless steel folding probe to test doneness of meat, cake, gril, and more. Within 3-5 seconds, readings with accuracy of ±1.8°F will pop up on the large LCD. √ Check the minimum/maximum temperature recorded.√ Voice prompts of the kitchen thermometer make it easier for the seniors and people with poor eyesight to achieve accurate readings. √ Easily control the doneness of 8 types of meat including beef and lamb.√ 4 degrees of doneness are available: medium-rare, medium, medium-well, and well-done. √ IP66 splash-resistant design keeps your waterproof cooking thermometer safe from splashes and more kitchen disasters.√ Auto power off after 10 minutes of no operation. √ A back magnetic means you can easily attach your Instant Read thermometer to metallic surface of home appliances for easy storage.√ Ideal for frying, making bread & candy, coffee, and home brew. Specifications: 1. Measurement range: 22°F ~ 572°F /-30°C ~ 300°C2. Resolution: 0.1°F / 0.1°C 3. Temperature units: °F or °C4. Folding probe: 4.25in, 0° ~ 180° 5. Accuracy: ±1.8°F (±1°C when measured in Celsius) in the range of -4°F ~ 392°F (-20°C ~ 200°C); ±3.6°F (2°C when measured in Celsius) in the rest of range6. Power supply: 2 x AAA batteries (not included) 9. Size: 6.77 x 1.45 x 0.86in / 172 x 37 x 22mm10. Net weight: approx. 3.10oz / 88g Package includes: 1 x Digital Meat Thermometer1 x Metal Clip1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lTmjWGELL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EForces","source_asin":"B07MMPT32W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MMPT32W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MMPT32W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
