window.products.push({"id":1090216,"name":"Scentsationals Day of The Dead Collection - 4-Pack 2.5oz Wax Cubes - Home Warmer Tart, Electric Wickless Candle Bar Air Freshener, Spa Aroma Decor Gif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HuJ+I8BoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PASTEL DE TRES LECHES / THREE MILK CAKE - A sweet and delicious blend of crushed cinnamon, vanilla bean, and sugar mingled to create a creamy mouthwatering blend SCENTSATIONALS WAX - 100% American Made. Each wax cube package is 2.5 ounces and includes 6 cubes. Each cube has hours and hours of fragrance in them. All of our waxes are carefully tested for quality and release amazing aromas into the air when melted. AMAZING FRAGRANCES - ScentSationals is the leader in wax warmers and wax melts. Choose from hundreds of different scents of waxes to use with your new wax burner. ScentSationals scented wax fragrance families include; Fresh, Floral, Wood, Fruit, Bakery and Spice. SAFE OPERATION - Our waxes do not produce open flames or have soot residue. It's an easy-to-use and works with wax warmers, a clean heat source. When a warmer heats up, it will start to melt the wax. As the wax melts, premium fragrances will fill the room. EASY CLEANUP & REUSE - There are multiple ways to clean wax warmers to prepare for a new wax cube. 1) Cotton Ball Method: Add cotton balls to soak up majority of the wax, turn off and wait until wax cools, then throw away cotton balls and wipe down hot plate. 2) Soft Wax Method: Let wax cool, turn on warmer for 2-3 minutes, then remove softened wax. SATISFIED CUSTOMERS - ScentSationals has had millions of satisfied customers. Each wax burner that we have goes through multiple extensive tests to ensure safety and quality. If you're looking to freshen up your home, bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, or any other rooms in your house, this is your top solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HuJ+I8BoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scentsationals","source_asin":"B0B9TTZQGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9TTZQGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9TTZQGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
