window.products.push({"id":1090247,"name":"Wireless Meat Thermometer for Grilling and Smoking, Remote Digital Cooking Food Barbecue Grill Thermometer with Dual Probe for Smoker Oven BBQ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ick3i8PyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【328ft Stable Signal Connection】Wireless meat thermometer with a professional remote signal up to 328 feet.You can remotely monitors the temperature of meat and the oven without having to stay there all the time. 【IPX7 Waterproof Probe and Multiple Cooking Modes】Smoker thermometer equipped with 1 food probe and 1 oven probe. Programmed with preset target temperatures for 8 different food (beef,pork,veal,lamb, burger,turkey, chicken, fish) and 5 different tastes.You could refer to the programmable alarms for preset temperatures that recommended by USDA, or manually set the required temperature according to your taste. 【High Accuracy and Easy Timing 】Instant read meat thermometer with a wide temp range of -4˚F to 572˚F (-20˚C to 300˚C), retrieves temperature precisely to within ±1.8°F/1°C and fast read times of 1-3 seconds. Timer with count-up and count-down function, easy to cook delicious food. 【Wide-view Backlit Screen】 Grill thermometer has a wide view screen. You can see the temperature on the screen clearly, both in dim light or under the sun. When the temperature of steak thermometers reaches the preset temperature or timer, the receiver will beep and the LCD backlit will be turned on to alert you the meat has reached the desired temperature. 【Cost-effective solution】The food thermometer meets the need to monitor different foods simultaneously,with timer, temperature alarm and large display, all the functions of other similar designs.To solve many problems, Such as scorching, it’s your food cooking partner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ick3i8PyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VAUNO","source_asin":"B09QKSD989","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QKSD989","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QKSD989","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1090248,"name":"Pyle PKEC12 - Rapid Egg Cooker and Vegetable Food Steamer - Adjustable Time Setting and Counter Top Safe - Stainless Steel Body and Transparent Cover ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gd7D2EWVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The NutriChef Electronic Food Steamer / Egg Cooker provides you with convenient food prep ability. Simple & hassle-free operation begins working instantly. Adjust the rotary knob for the time setting and you will start to see the steam begin to cook your food through the heat-resistant transparent lid cover. The sleek stainless steel style & stain resistant construction is lightweight and compact -- making it the perfect addition to any kitchen countertop. The system includes an egg tray and height extending tier to cook more foods like vegetables, eggs, seafood and more. Enjoy convenient kitchen style with the NutriChef Electronic Food Steamer / Egg Cooker.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gd7D2EWVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NutriChef","source_asin":"B019FFH4ZE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019FFH4ZE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019FFH4ZE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
