window.products.push({"id":1090360,"name":"Chefman Multi-Function Oval Pressure Cooker 8 Quart Extra Large Programmable Multicooker, 18 Presets to Slow Cook, Sauté, Steam, Sear, Nonstick Pot, A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pgtVWOHRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your family’s favorite foods come in all shapes and sizes, so why should your pressure cooker? Make your family’s favorite meals in an instant with The Chefman Electric Pressure Cooker. Designed with an oval shape and an extra-large capacity, it accommodates large pot roasts, as well as big batches of stew or soup to feed the hungriest family, and still have leftovers for the week ahead. The ideal kitchen tool for big families, parties, holidays and events, this multicooker has a wide range of presets and cooking controls to master your meal prep. This all-in-one appliance replaces your current kitchen appliances with 18 built in presets to pressure cook, slow cook, steam or sauté your favorite foods to perfection and reduce wait times by up to 70% compared to traditional stovetop cooking methods. Perfect for set-it-and-forget-it recipes, this 8 quart pressure cooker opens a bigger world of culinary possibilities. Quickly cook anything from classic comfort foods, vegetables, meats, grains, yogurt, breakfast and even dessert. Get breakfast on the table faster by pressure cooking your steel cut oats. Or step up your toast game with perfectly soft-boiled eggs on avocado toast. Hungry for lunch? Multi-task in one pot for delicious mac n’ cheese or stir-fried veggies. No need to turn on the oven or stove, and even better, no need to wash a sink full of dirty dishes. With the Chefman 1300-Watt Multi-Cooker in your kitchen, it’s all about maximum flavor and minimum fuss. The ultimate tool for flexible cooking, this electric cooker has a 12-hour timer that delays cooking so you can prepare meals in advance, as well as a 24 hour keep-warm function to keep your food at the perfect temperature until serving. For easy cleanup, the non-stick cooking pot, steam rack, steam basket, rice spoon, ladle, and measuring cup are all dishwasher safe. To learn more about how to use your Chefman Pressure Cooker and all the ways it fits into your cooking style, read the User Guide in full.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pgtVWOHRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefman","source_asin":"B08CSN9JJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CSN9JJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CSN9JJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
