window.products.push({"id":1090393,"name":"Coffee Canister Stainless Steel Airtight Coffee Container with Date-Tracker, CO2-Release Valve, Measuring Scoop Large Coffee Container for Kitchen, Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D9pSoKCUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP YOUR COFFEE FRESH！ To preserve your coffee beans' fresh roasted flavor as long as possible, a good storage condition is the key. Air, moisture and light can affect coffee beans' flavor and taste during the storage. So you need to choose a coffee canister that can help protect your beans or grounds from air, moisture and light. Stored in a cool, dry place, your coffee stays rich and full of flavor. Full flavor starts with fresh coffee. Stainless Steel Liner！ Use the food-grade stainless steel to ensure that the container is durable and safe. After repeated tests by many coffee lovers, it can perfectly preserve the freshness of coffee beans. Effectively preserve coffee Beans, dried fruits, grains, soybeans and other foods. This is a must-have storage container for coffee lovers. Packing Included: 1 x Coffee Canister 1 x Stainless Steel Scoop Warm Tips: Please rinse thoroughly before the first use. Rinse with neutral cleaner. Let dry after washing. Please store in a cool, dry place and avoid direct sunlight. Please do not scratch the surface with hard materials such as a steel scrubber.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D9pSoKCUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vrisa","source_asin":"B08QN278WB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QN278WB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QN278WB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
