window.products.push({"id":1090511,"name":"Power Rangers Blanket, 50\"x60\", Stance Silky Touch Sherpa Back Super Soft Throw Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613w-KLhiFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"POWER RANGERS 50\"X60\" STANCE SILKY TOUCH SHERPA BACK SUPER SOFT BLANKET - This lush one-sided sherpa fleece throw blanket with a 240gsm fleece face and 180gsm plush sherpa reverse is warm and cozy, lightweight, breathable, and durable. It has an unfolded size of 50” x 60” making it perfect for sleeping, napping on the sofa or couch, traveling, or snuggling up when watching TV. SHRINK and FADE RESISTANT – This comfy and fluffy sherpa blanket made of 100% polyester is fade and stain resistant. Hand-printed in the USA using a dye sublimation process, the designs have amazing color vibrancy and are long lasting. Printed one-side only. EASY CARE – Our products are machine washable. Wash on gentle cycle and tumble dry on low heat. Do not use bleach. Disclaimer: Blanket may arrive flat due to the printing process. We advise that you wash it before the first using to remove the excessive lint left over during the manufacturing process. OFFICIALLY LICENSED - Each of our designs are officially licensed and 100% authentic. Our fan-favored imagery is created by our brilliant in-house team of graphic artists, and is often hand-drawn and illustrated, adding unique detailing to each design. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - Our blankets make the perfect gift for the enthusiast in your life. Ideal for birthday, Christmas & holiday gifts or just treating yourself! If you are unsatisfied with our product for any reason, we will gladly replace it or refund you immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613w-KLhiFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Logovision","source_asin":"B09F6WYRTK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F6WYRTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F6WYRTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1090512,"name":"KESSAKU 8-Inch Serrated Bread Knife - Ronin Series - Forged High Carbon 7Cr17MoV Stainless Steel - Pakkawood Handle with Blade Guard","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811tYJEtOjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RONIN SERIES - Distinguished by the eye-catching subtle beauty of their finely etched blades & end caps, our Ronin Series knives were lovingly designed by our artisans to reflect centuries of traditional Japanese knife design, paired with cutting-edge nitrogen-cooled forging techniques & the highest-grade materials for unparalleled craftsmanship. Perfectly balanced contour-bolstered handles for amazing comfort & safety, with sharp & spectacular blades (up to 2x sharper than competing brands). MAJESTICALLY SHARP BLADE — Exquisite Seigaiha pattern. Individually handcrafted & hand-sharpened by our virtuoso technicians in the complex 3-stage traditional Honbazuke method to 16° per side for clean, precise, cuts, & amazing edge-retention. Our formulated High-Carbon 7Cr17MoV Stainless Steel adds enhanced corrosion resistance & non-stick properties, and these Precision-Forged, Nitrogen-Cooled, blades have a Rockwell Hardness of 58 for maximum strength, flexibility, & blade edge durability. TO HAVE & TO HOLD — An amazing first impression. Beautifully adorned with two gorgeous resin bands reminiscent of twin moons or celestial wedding rings, this knife's Mirror-Polished Pakkawood Handle will feel as if it were made just for you, specifically. This impact-resistant handle has Full Tang Strength for a lifetime of safe & precise use, is nearly impervious to heat, cold, & moisture, and its seamless build ensures that debris can't infiltrate its body, keeping it sanitary & hygienic. CONSTRUCTED TO LAST FOREVER - This knife will be your culinary companion for life & comes with Kessaku’s 100% Lifetime Warranty. Because we work tirelessly to ensure you’re delivered a true quality culinary masterpiece, all of our knives come with our Kessaku True Lifetime Warranty. Our very highest priority is that you are completely thrilled with our products and truly in love with our brand. Contact us with any issue or concerns and we will immediately do our absolute best to make it right. MAKES AN AMAZING PRESENT  —  This magnificent knife will arrive in style, greeting you in our beautifully designed & elegant Magnetic Closure Gift Box, Custom Sheath & Polishing Cloth. Perfect for a Birthday, Wedding, Anniversary, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Christmas, Housewarming. Give this to your favorite chef. The astonishing quality of this lovingly crafted, professional knife means you’ll be giving them a gift that they’ll have & use for eternity, so they’ll always think of you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811tYJEtOjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KESSAKU","source_asin":"B08M4K2CHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M4K2CHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M4K2CHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
