window.products.push({"id":1090676,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Beach Surf III by Karen Fields, 16x24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C7GtaWQwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features waves rolling up coast line. Prominent colors: white, turquoise, tan, blue, grey world art Group is a leading art publisher located in Richmond, Virginia. We have been producing wall decor for over 40 years. Formerly known as old world prints, world art Group publishes a comprehensive line of imagery ranging from very traditional to highly contemporary. With Weekly releases, covering every subject matter and every price range, we produce over 4, 000 images a year. In addition to collaborating with artists from around the world, world art Group has its own in-house design team vision studio. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C7GtaWQwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07MBBZ1TJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MBBZ1TJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MBBZ1TJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1090677,"name":"HOMICHEF Commercial Grade LARGE STOCK POT 20 Quart With Lid - Nickel Free Stainless Steel Cookware Stockpot 20 Quart - Healthy Cookware Polished Stock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ceplg4BCL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"LARGE, QUALITY BUILD STOCKPOTS - These commercial grade stockpots are large and heavy-duty, great for boiling lobster, crab, or simmering stocks, soups for large crowds. - 7MM thick, undeformable 3-ply base eliminates warping and hotspots effectively and ensures optimal thermal absorption and transmission, thus faster cooking and more energy savings. - Solid riveted stainless steel handles stay cool on stovetops. - Beautifully engineered by HOMICHEF's own in house manufacturing facilities at the world top quality. - Compatible with gas, induction, electric, ceramic, glass and halogen stovetops. GO HEALTHY & GREEN WITH HOMICHEF HEALTHY COOKWARE - Made of food grade NICKEL FREE stainless steel: non-toxic, non-allergic, and more energy savings - Japanese standard JYH21CT SS (21/0) for the pot body and the inner base; 430 SS (18/0) for the outer base - Nickel-bearing SS is commonly used for cookware, BUT nickel is high up on the ATSDR list of priority toxins and it LEACHES under regular cooking conditions. - Nickel free stainless steel is not only healthier, but also more heat-conductive than nickel bearing SS. Tests show a noticeable degree (12-15%) of energy savings. - Enjoy green and safe cooking with HOMICHEF healthy cookware. ELEGANT APPEARANCE The featured timeless French kitchen elegance design cuts a fine figure both in the kitchen and at the dining table. - Mirror polished exterior and matte polished interior - See-through clear tempered glass lid with steam vent - Ergonomical stainless steel handles DEVOTED SERVICES - 1-MONTH Free Trial - 6-YEAR Warranty - LIFETIME Customer Service. Please come to us at any time for discounted parts, product issues, cooking consultations, etc.Discover the gourmet chef in you with these HEALTHY & BEAUTIFUL & EFFICIENT stockpots.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ceplg4BCL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMICHEF","source_asin":"B07BRHZDXN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BRHZDXN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BRHZDXN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
