window.products.push({"id":1090872,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner, 4-IN-1 Evaporative Air Cooler | Tower Fan | Humidifier | Negative ions Cooling Fan w/Remote, 3 Modes, 3 Fan Speeds, 7H Timer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FpgVJ6VwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【4-IN-1 Function Make You Impeccable】Advanced cooling technology, equipped with an industry-leading honeycomb cascade system, use with ice crystals that transmits hot air over ice water to distribute the cold air throughout the room quickly. In addition to cooling the air quickly, our air coolers also have humidification, negative ions and fan functions. Turning on the negative ion function can release 3.5 million negative ions to freshen the air, circulates air circulation. ❄【Sleep Mode & Timer & Remote Control】3 modes of normal, natural and sleep mode for your choice with this standing air cooler. Sleep soundly throughout the night without waking up in a sweaty mess. Set the 1-7hrs timer function, no worry about being cold at night. The minimum wind speed is 50 db which does not disturb your rest. And remote control offers you totally peace and enjoy without getting up from bed, we consider for you with everything you need. ❄【Ultra-quiet and Safe Design】 Air cooler should never be an annoying good. The noise of this cooler is as low as 50 decibels, which is considered whisper-quiet. Sweet dreams and peaceful work can be achieved with the help of it. Fan blades can be closed manually to effectively prevent the danger of children’s cute finger inserting, and the machine will automatically beep when the water in the water tank has dried up, all of which are designed to provide a safe and cool environment for you. ❄【Top Refilling & Large 5L Water Tank & 4 Ice Packs】Tired of bending over and adding water frequently? Our portable air conditioning fan is designed with easy top refilling which is friendly to the elder and disable person, what’s more, the 5L big capacity water tank allows this evaporative cooler run up to 21hours after full refill. This personal air cooler also comes with extra 4 Ice packs which could deliver continuous cooling repeatably. ❄【360° Universal Wheels & 90° Oscillation】Do you need a portable AC cooler which is easy to remove in rooms, well, our air cooler for room is the perfect choice. Comes with 4 universal wheels which allows you easily take it to any rooms, no extra installation needed. The fan blades can rotate auto by 90 ° in the horizontal direction or manually by 120° in the vertical direction to supply multi-angle cold air. It also can be closed completely when not in use to avoid dust accumulation. ❄【Lifesaver for Energy and Bill 】Portable Air Conditioner working power is only 65W, compared to air conditioner: lower installation and maintenance costs, up to 75% less electricity usage to reduce your bills, no ozone damaging refrigerants, and adds moisture to air-reducing dry air symptoms such as itchy eyes, throat, or skin in dry climates. The treatment of Freon-free is good for protecting the atmosphere and improving our living environment. Is there any reason not to try one? ❄【Warm Note】Please make sure the blades are manually opened before you turn on the fan. ( tear off the protective film on two sides and manually open the blades by pull one of them up). Make sure the water is refilling till it's above the MIN mark(the water line) at the bottom of the machine. It will start to pump water and go down through the top tank, then it realize a cooling off affect when you choose COOL mode. Please notice that: This machine DOESN'T MIST under COOL mode.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FpgVJ6VwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uvistare","source_asin":"B08K37J1D5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090872","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K37J1D5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K37J1D5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1090873,"name":"Coolnice 12inch Lazy Susan Turntable 360°Rotating Spice Rack Non-Skid Plastic Round Kitchen Spice Organizer Multifunctional Turntable Cabinet Organize","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f+WN8m75L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"High-quality materials:Made of durable plastic,high temperature resistance,external thread design of our lazy susan turntable,smooth surface,will not scratch your hands.Elegant surfaces mean that they will not only provide storage space,but also add a stylish touch to your home and decoration. Large capacity,save more space: Our lazy susan spice racks are 12 inches( large lazy susan).which can meet your large storage needs. 360°Rotating Lazy Turntable: The lazy susan turntable is operated by a smooth stainless steel ball bearing and can be rotated 360°. Each rotation is very convenient, so that you can easily get what you want without moving the storage tray Anti-slip Design:The bottom of the lazy turntable is designed with anti-slip mats. When rotating, there is no need to worry about the items in the storage box sliding out. The bottom is stable and not easy to shake. The higher edge prevents the item from falling and helps to hold the item in place when it is rotated. There are double smooth handles on both sides for easy movement. This sorting rack can bear a heavy load of more than 5kg. Multi-purpose Lazy Turntable-Our lazy Susan can be used to store canned food, snacks, cakes, stationery, cosmetics, various gadgets, etc. They can be excellent storage organizers and can be placed on the kitchen, cabinet, pantry, closet, bathroom, desktop or dressing table according to your needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f+WN8m75L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coolnice","source_asin":"B08S6KGS72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1090873","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S6KGS72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S6KGS72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
